From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix: preserve Pi 5 boot selection without writable EFI variables

Keep installation strict. During upgrade and rollback, use loader.conf only
when firmware rejects nonvolatile variable writes with EINVAL. Honor that
default while probing, and preserve the booted entry through upgrade cleanup
and asset copying until the new image has been copied successfully.

